# GHL free consultation calendar links (shown to qualified leads)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GHL_CALENDAR_LONDON=https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/...
NEXT_PUBLIC_GHL_CALENDAR_GLASGOW=https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/...

# Vercel Blob (auto-populated when the Blob store is connected on Vercel)
